WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:16.800
Ey.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.480
I...

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.040
I wanted to thank you for saving us.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.600
No, no, no. Hold on. Listen.

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.200
It's all on me.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.640
What do you mean?

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.960
I mean, I used to work for Greg.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.120
I thought he was the smartest guy

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:36.000
out there.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.520
But your man...

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.760
He outsmarted him.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.600
Mason gave me the fake documents.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.480
Then I went

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.960
and handed them over to Greg.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.760
No questions asked.

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.840
Then I...

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.680
I don't understand.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:53.680
Yeah, I was just the eyes and

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.040
ears in this place.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.920
No, I mean, I don't understand.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.680
Why did you save us?

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.800
Don't you get it?

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:11.320
I love you.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:12.160
I love you, Veronica.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:13.640
With all my heart.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:14.480
From the first day

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.800
I started working for you.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:22.240
Listen, I don't need anything in return.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:25.120
I know you love him.

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:26.360
I never gonna forgive myself

00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:27.840
for betraying the Aspen family.
